      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, I'd be happy to help you draft an outline. Once you send me the survey data, I will analyze it and create a comprehensive outline that includes the key findings and insights from the culture report. The final report will focus on the actual content and substance, giving the Honesty and Honesty Index (HHI) at the back of the report. Here is an example outline for your annual culture report: \n\nI. Executive Summary\n   A. Purpose of the Report\n   B. Highlights and Takeaways from Survey Data \n\nII. Background Information\n    A. Overview of Aether Systems\n    B. Role and Impact of Culture in Business \n    C. Goal and Objectives of the Culture Report \n\nIII. Methodology\n    A. Data Gathering Process\n    B. Division of Survey Topics \n    C. Inclusivity Index and Honesty Index (HI) Explanation\n\nIV. Survey Findings\n    A. Diversity & Equity Insights\n    B. Inclusion in the Workplace\n    C. Access to Resources & Opportunities \n    D. Belonging & Community Feel \n    E. Representation of Underrepresented Groups\n    F. Key Strengths and Areas for Improvement\n\nV. Recommendations & Best Practices\n    A. Areas",
      "source": "target",
